{"id":1130301,"chapter_id":1130301,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"审查室中的堇看上去安静而从容，似乎完全不知道自己的处境——","style":3,"log_type":2,"src_id":230301002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1130300},{"step":2,"content":"FAC专员很快会抵达MBCC并对堇进行特别审问。还有大约30分钟的缓冲时间，这足够你提前了解一些信息了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1130300},{"step":3,"content":"察觉到你的到来，堇朝你微笑颔首。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":4,"speaker":"堇","content":"您好，局长。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1130300},{"step":5,"options":["回应堇的问好"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301008,"trial_step":8,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"回应堇的问好","goto":9}]},{"step":6,"content":"你好，久闻大名，堇女士。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1130300},{"step":7,"content":"听说你的作品很受新城达官显贵的欢迎，市场上总是供不应求。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1130300},{"step":8,"speaker":"堇","content":"承蒙错爱，区区虚名不足挂齿。我的技艺还有待精进。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1130301},{"step":9,"content":"管理局的营区内也有一片花园。你有需要的话，可以在休息时间自由使用。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1130300},{"step":10,"speaker":"堇","content":"感激不尽。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1130300},{"step":11,"speaker":"堇","content":"不过，您今天找我，应该不是为了管理局<color=#e45515>花园</color>的事吧？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1130302},{"step":12,"content":"堇说话的时候，脸上一直挂着和煦的笑容，令人猜不透在想什么。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1130300},{"step":13,"content":"但你知道，FAC的情报没有出错，堇很可能就是组织“花园” 的人，至少也是知道一些情报的相关人员。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1130300},{"step":14,"content":"时间紧迫，专员即将赶到，没时间绕圈子了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1130300},{"step":15,"content":"另一个“花园”的事，你能说给我听听吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1130300},{"step":16,"speaker":"堇","content":"我会尽力回答的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1130300},{"step":17,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":20,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":18,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":20,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":19,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":20,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":20,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":20,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":21,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":20,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":22,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":20,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":23,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":20,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":24,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":20,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":25,"content":"这份调查报告里说，花园是一个存在于地下的老牌组织，并且多年未曾有正式成员暴露或被捕……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1130300},{"step":26,"content":"堇翻动着这总共不过三页的报告书。即便情报如此之少，她还是认真地看了好几遍。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1130301},{"step":27,"speaker":"堇","content":"您的情报没有问题。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1130301},{"step":28,"speaker":"堇","content":"不过，信息有些少……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1130301},{"step":29,"content":"报告上的有效情报的确少得可怜。考虑到FAC的情报力量，这很不正常。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1130300},{"step":30,"speaker":"堇","content":"嗯，不该苛责收集情报的人……这份工作对他们来说的确太过危险了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1130300},{"step":31,"options":["危险？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301027,"trial_step":27,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"危险？","goto":28}]},{"step":32,"content":"你的意思是花园会杀害FAC的情报人员？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1130300},{"step":33,"speaker":"堇","content":"一个隐秘的组织，必须及时清理威胁。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1130302},{"step":34,"content":"堇神色如常，脸上的笑意没有减少半分。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1130300},{"step":35,"content":"所以花园就敢于对FAC的人动手？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1130300},{"step":36,"content":"那是狄斯城最庞大的官方机构，拥有过万的常备武装人员……过去的无数事实已经证明了，无论多么凶残的禁闭者都无法与之抗衡。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1130300},{"step":37,"speaker":"堇","content":"您说得没错，FAC非常强大，对待禁闭者的态度也十分的……严苛。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1130302},{"step":38,"speaker":"堇","content":"正因如此，花园这样的禁闭者组织，才更不会避开他们。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1130300},{"step":39,"options":["花园不怕FAC报复吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"花园不怕FAC报复吗？","goto":36}]},{"step":40,"speaker":"堇","content":"他们做不到。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1130301},{"step":41,"speaker":"堇","content":"刚刚的文件也证明了，FAC对花园知之甚少，不是么？仅凭这些浮光掠影的情报，是没办法触及花园的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1130300},{"step":42,"content":"花园可以躲过FAC的搜查？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1130300},{"step":43,"speaker":"堇","content":"花园是非常核心的组织。大多数外围人员甚至不知道自己在为花园服务。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1130300},{"step":44,"content":"组织内的人呢？你们一次都没失手过？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1130300},{"step":45,"speaker":"堇","content":"据我所知……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1130301},{"step":46,"speaker":"堇","content":"是的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1130300},{"step":47,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1130300},{"step":48,"options":["花园存在多久了？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301044,"trial_step":44,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"花园存在多久了？","goto":45}]},{"step":49,"speaker":"堇","content":"比狄斯城其他任何同行都要久。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1130301},{"step":50,"content":"堇的回答令你有些不寒而栗。这意味着一个极端危险的组织已经存在多年，却没有任何人意识到他们的存在。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1130300},{"step":51,"options":["<color=#e45515>你们</color>有特别的暗杀方式？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301047,"trial_step":47,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"<color=#e45515>你们</color>有特别的暗杀方式？","goto":48}]},{"step":52,"content":"堇眨眨眼，没有在你关键的称呼转变上多做纠缠。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1130302},{"step":53,"speaker":"堇","content":"花园是一个禁闭者组织……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1130302},{"step":54,"content":"禁闭者危险莫测的能力确实可以掩盖许多重要信息。不过这样的回答还是太宽泛了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1130300},{"step":55,"content":"你的手上还有一份卷宗，凭借它应该能缩小花园杀手的身份范围。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1130300},{"step":56,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":57,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":58,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":59,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":60,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":61,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":62,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1130300},{"step":63,"content":"这是近年来FAC意外死亡人员的名单。堇接了过去，这次她翻阅得非常快。厚厚一沓名单，她只看了不到两分钟。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1130301},{"step":64,"content":"翻阅完之后，她合上名单，又看向你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1130301},{"step":65,"options":["说说5月30日的事情"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301055,"trial_step":55,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"说说5月30日的事情","goto":56}]},{"step":66,"content":"维泽·莫玛，5月30日早晨4:00左右死于心脏衰竭。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1130300},{"step":67,"content":"李斯特·兰帕，5月30日上午8:51死于车祸。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1130300},{"step":68,"content":"邓普林，5月30日晚间9:00左右死于溺水。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1130300},{"step":69,"content":"死因看上去并没有问题，但同一天，一连三位FAC官员死亡，这件事本身就极其异常。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1130300},{"step":70,"content":"这也是FAC的情报官在报告上着重圈出的疑点——“最有可能是花园所为的刺杀案件。”","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1130300},{"step":71,"speaker":"堇","content":"这些人，的确是花园的目标。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1130300},{"step":72,"content":"你正准备向堇求证。她却提前开口，仿佛已经知道了你想要问什么。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1130300},{"step":73,"content":"怎么做到的？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1130300},{"step":74,"speaker":"堇","content":"这并不困难，只是需要经验和耐心。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1130300},{"step":75,"content":"要想一直解决FAC的成员却不被发现，光有这些可不够。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1130300},{"step":76,"speaker":"堇","content":"我们还有一项最为便利和隐秘的工具……禁闭者能力。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1130303},{"step":77,"content":"……那这几个人是你杀的吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1130303},{"step":78,"speaker":"堇","content":"不，按照花园的规矩，这种级别的委托不该由我负责。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1130303},{"step":79,"content":"什么样的人才轮得到你出手？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1130303},{"step":80,"content":"堇没有回答，只是笑着，目光温和，直直盯着你。这副表情，让你没来由地有些发怵，不愿追问。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1130302},{"step":81,"content":"酝酿片刻，你问出了下一个问题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1130302},{"step":82,"options":["为什么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301072,"trial_step":72,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"为什么？","goto":73}]},{"step":83,"speaker":"堇","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1130301},{"step":84,"content":"面对突如其来的提问，堇难得显得有些困惑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1130300},{"step":85,"speaker":"堇","content":"花园是最好的，自然不会过分挑拣委托目标。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1130303},{"step":86,"speaker":"堇","content":"何况目标是几乎所有禁闭者都敌视的FAC。花园有能力和意愿完成这样的委托。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1130303},{"step":87,"content":"我不是在问为什么你们要刺杀FAC的人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1130300},{"step":88,"content":"你自己就是所谓的“花园核心人员”吧。这样毫无顾忌地吐露组织的情报，不符合你们组织的风格吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1130300},{"step":89,"content":"想成为污点证人，还是你和花园出现了矛盾？亦或你根本就是主动落网想要布下什么陷阱？你的目的究竟是什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1130300},{"step":90,"speaker":"堇","content":"不，我非常敬爱花园的大家。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1130301},{"step":91,"speaker":"堇","content":"……如果您愿意相信的话，就当作是一个警告吧。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1130300},{"step":92,"content":"警告？警告我放了你？还是警告花园要来杀我？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1130300},{"step":93,"content":"听到你的追问，堇一时有些错愕，旋即恢复笑容。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1130300},{"step":94,"speaker":"堇","content":"我只是希望……您，还有FAC，不要再调查花园了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1130301},{"step":95,"speaker":"堇","content":"你们什么都不会得到。这些行为只会引发花园的反扑。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1130300},{"step":96,"content":"花园准备公然对抗FAC？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1130300},{"step":97,"speaker":"堇","content":"“准备”这个字眼不太准确。花园一直将FAC视作敌人。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1130302},{"step":98,"content":"可你已经透露了如此之多的关键情报——你的身份、花园的行事风格。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1130300},{"step":99,"content":"综合你过去在新城的花道家身份，只要发起大规模排查，就一定能找到更多的花园成员。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1130300},{"step":100,"content":"一旦暴露了自己的身份，你们还能威胁到FAC吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1130300},{"step":101,"speaker":"堇","content":"如果只有我们，或许的确不够。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1130300},{"step":102,"speaker":"堇","content":"但花园还拥有真正的底牌。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1130301},{"step":103,"content":"什么样的底牌？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1130300},{"step":104,"content":"堇的脸上出现了些许犹豫。片刻之后，她还是说出了一个名字。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1130300},{"step":105,"speaker":"堇","content":"……“业师”。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1130300},{"step":106,"options":["业师？那是谁"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301096,"trial_step":96,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"业师？那是谁","goto":97}]},{"step":107,"speaker":"堇","content":"……她是真正的花道家，花园的主宰。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1130301},{"step":108,"speaker":"堇","content":"每一支花，都是借由她，才获得了新生。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1130301},{"step":109,"content":"仅凭一个人，就敢于对抗整个FAC？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1130300},{"step":110,"speaker":"堇","content":"是的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1130300},{"step":111,"content":"在说出这句话的时候，堇没有表现出半点迟疑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1130300},{"step":112,"content":"这不可能。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1130300},{"step":113,"speaker":"堇","content":"……您没有亲自面对过业师，体会不到她的力量。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1130301},{"step":114,"content":"气氛僵持了一会儿。你长长地出了口气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1130300},{"step":115,"content":"你刚刚说过，你敬爱花园的同僚，对吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1130300},{"step":116,"speaker":"堇","content":"是的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1130300},{"step":117,"content":"那你对FAC怎么看？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1130300},{"step":118,"speaker":"堇","content":"若非委托，我并不喜欢杀人。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1130300},{"step":119,"speaker":"堇","content":"我更愿意多花些时间练习花道……可惜，我早已做出了选择。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1130301},{"step":120,"content":"虽然没有明说，但堇的态度还算明确，她对FAC应该没有特别的恨意。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1130300},{"step":121,"content":"既然如此，我希望你能将花园的全部情报如数告知。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1130300},{"step":122,"speaker":"堇","content":"为什么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1130302},{"step":123,"content":"这次轮到堇发问了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1130300},{"step":124,"content":"FAC已经察觉到花园的存在，并打算对付你们了。你也知道，FAC对禁闭者的手段比较……激烈。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1130300},{"step":125,"content":"堇点点头，肯定了你的说法。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1130300},{"step":126,"content":"如果你能向我透露更多情报，包括业师在内，我就能先FAC一步收容花园的其他禁闭者。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1130300},{"step":127,"content":"凭借管理局和枷锁的力量，我会阻止双方爆发更大的冲突。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1130300},{"step":128,"speaker":"堇","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1130300},{"step":129,"speaker":"堇","content":"您还是这么……温柔。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1130301},{"step":130,"content":"温柔在这个世道下，不算什么好品质。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1130300},{"step":131,"content":"我只是想要避免无谓的牺牲。无论是FAC，还是花园。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1130300},{"step":132,"speaker":"堇","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1130301},{"step":133,"content":"堇脸上的笑容变得有些苦涩。良久的沉默过后，她轻轻叹了口气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1130300},{"step":134,"speaker":"堇","content":"请恕我无法答应您的请求。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1130300},{"step":135,"speaker":"堇","content":"我确实告诉了您太多的情报，其中一些情报甚至已经触及花园的核心，但这都是为了……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1130300},{"step":136,"content":"堇顿了顿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1130300},{"step":137,"speaker":"堇","content":"我不能背叛花园。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1130300},{"step":138,"content":"事情已经不是你能控制的了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1130300},{"step":139,"content":"FAC的特别专员不用多久就能抵达。如果他使用非常手段逼迫你吐露实情，我甚至无权阻止。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1130300},{"step":140,"speaker":"堇","content":"我会告诉您这些，是因为我在以花道家的身份与您交谈。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1130303},{"step":141,"speaker":"堇","content":"面对FAC的人……花园的造物是不会讲话的。您不用担心。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1130303},{"step":142,"content":"我担心的当然不是这个……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1130300},{"step":143,"speaker":"堇","content":"况且，他说不定没法赶到这里。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1130302},{"step":144,"content":"没法赶到这里？什么意思？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1130300},{"step":145,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，专员的车即将抵达，申请放行。","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1130300},{"step":146,"options":["让他进来吧"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301136,"trial_step":136,"course":3,"drawing":1130300,"choices":[{"text":"让他进来吧","goto":137}]},{"step":147,"content":"堇的审问一时半会无法解决。你有些焦躁地起身拿起桌上的卷宗，准备前去迎接FAC专员。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1130300},{"step":148,"content":"一个信封从卷宗中间滑出，掉落在地面上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1130300},{"step":149,"speaker":"堇","content":"这是……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1130304},{"step":150,"content":"你思考了几秒，发现想不起来这封信的来历。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1130304},{"step":151,"content":"这个不在资料目录里，应该是某个工作人员的私人物品。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1130304},{"step":152,"speaker":"堇","content":"我能……看看它吗？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230301142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1130304},{"step":153,"content":"测试全屏类文本对演出效果的支持","style":14,"background":50409,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":143,"course":6,"drawing"